---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { formatDate } from "../lib/date";

const updated = new Date("2025-03-20");
---

<Base title="Now · Janis Schubert">
  <h1 class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Now</h1>
  <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400">What I am up to at the moment. Inspired by the now page movement, updated when I remember.</p>
  <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-neutral-500">Last updated <time datetime={updated.toISOString()}>{formatDate(updated, "long")}</time></p>

  <h2 class="mt-10 text-xl font-semibold">Work</h2>
  <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">Still backend in TypeScript. This year it is less glue code and more shaping how services talk to each other, which is the part I enjoy.</p>

  <h2 class="mt-10 text-xl font-semibold">Learning</h2>
  <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">Writing short notes here instead of long posts nowhere. Tailwind 4 taught me more CSS than Tailwind 3 ever did, oddly.</p>

  <h2 class="mt-10 text-xl font-semibold">Not doing</h2>
  <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">Keeping a reading list. Removed it today, it had become a list of guilt.</p>
</Base>
